      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JAZZY BOO (8) boasts a strong record this journey with 16 wins and seven minors from 35 tries. Comes off a (17.82) win last time, scoring by half a length in a Other over 305m at this track. With a clean break looks hard to beat. FERNANDO LEE (2) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (17.83) at this track in a Other over 305m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. JUST RYLEE (4) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (18.24) in a Other at this track. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Likely to be about the money. BULSARA (6) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
